    "detailed_description": "Immerse yourself in a murky point &amp; click adventure with an anime aesthetic, where you must solve a series of murders while confronting the ghosts of your own past.<br><br>In &quot;Gloomy Clues&quot; you'll step into the shoes of John, a detective tormented by guilt and haunted by a tragedy that pushed him to the brink. After some time away from the police force, John receives a chance at redemption: a series of cases that will force him to face his own demons and a truth that could destroy him.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Investigate dark and evocative scenarios: Explore a city shrouded in shadows, where each case hides even deeper secrets.<br></li><li>Unravel a plot full of twists: Interrogate suspects, analyze clues, and make difficult decisions that will determine John's fate.<br></li><li>Immerse yourself in a disturbing atmosphere: Be captivated by the unique anime style and an evocative soundtrack that will keep you on edge.<br></li><li>Confront the inner darkness: Discover the truth about John's split personality and fight to control the &quot;Master of Illusion&quot; before it's too late.</li></ul>",
